     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking and answering",
     "texto": [
      "**Pourquoi** asks why: **Pourquoi tu ne viens pas ?** (why aren't you coming?).",
      "**Parce que** answers: **Parce que je suis fatigué** (because I'm tired)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Mais», «donc», «alors»",
     "texto": [
      "**Mais** = but: **Je suis fatigué, mais je viens** (I'm tired, but I'm coming).",
      "**Donc** = so, therefore: **Il pleut, donc je reste à la maison** (it's raining, so I'm staying at home).",
      "**Alors** = then: **Alors, on part ?** (so, shall we go?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
